<mxCell id="box_c1c_callout" value="JUSTIFIED ABSENCE OF MFA FOR FIELD (ASM-091):&#10;1. Adoption: Overcomes distrust of leaving notebook; app has few screens.&#10;2. Connectivity: Works offline in remote rural veredas; queues outbox.&#10;3. Limited Scope: User sees ONLY own farms / trips; small blast radius.&#10;4. Compensating Controls: Hardware keystore outbox encryption (ASM-095),&#10;   device_id binding, local screen lock, server-side scope enforcement." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f0f9ff;strokeColor=#0284c7;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0c4a6e;fontSize=11.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="790" y="1025" width="620" height="95" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
