<mxCell id="box_c2_isolation" value="ARCHITECTURAL ISOLATION GATE (Security §8.4, Sack &amp; Trip §10):&#10;• The buyer view is a separate physical projection store (buyer_view table).&#10;• Lookup IAM role holds grants ONLY on buyer_view and public_view KMS key.&#10;• A coding error in the lookup service CANNOT return fields from transactional,&#10;  personal, or telemetry stores because IAM and KMS deny access at infrastructure level." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef2f2;strokeColor=#dc2626;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#7f1d1d;fontSize=11.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="2690" y="500" width="680" height="95" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="m208" value="6: buyer_view returns projection record (origin, dates, status, drying variables | ASM-096)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#065f46;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;endSize=8;" edge="1" parent="1">
