  </mxGeometry>
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="box_c2_fields" value="DATA WITHHOLDING INVARIANTS (Security §8.2, §8.3):&#10;EXACTLY 4 GROUPS RETURNED:&#10;1. Origin: sack_code, department, municipality (coarse geography only).&#10;2. Processing Dates: drying_start_date, drying_end_date, packing_date (calendar dates, no times).&#10;3. Status: current sack state (in preparation, en route center, center accepted/rejected, en route port, port accepted/rejected).&#10;4. Drying Variables: final_coffee_moisture_pct, grain_temperature_min/mean/max_c.&#10;&#10;STRICTLY WITHHELD (NEVER EXPOSED):&#10;• Farmer name, cédula, phone, subject_id.&#10;• Farm name, coordinates, polygon, vereda.&#10;• Farm node IDs, raw telemetry series.&#10;• Transporter identity, vehicle plate, trip ID, positions.&#10;• Custody event timestamps, weights, collection center, rejection reasons, pest records." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f3ff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#4c1d95;fontSize=11.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="1960" y="650" width="710" height="235" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
